{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52549","headline":"真人操 · 陈元光","name":"真人操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴阳妙教生真人，名山胜地隐其身。\n吹嘘濑气完元神，陞降雪外离烟尘。\n轩辕乘龙万岁春，穆观王母存崑仑。\n青牛出关避世纷，招呼鸾鹤引霞樽。\n秦王汉武心尘土，欲求真仙恶得覩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}